      "nets": ["DISP_SCL", "Net-(U5-Pad2)"],
      "observed": "The netlist contains an extra 74LVC1G34 buffer U5. U2 pin 34 (PB13) is on net Net-(U5-Pad2) driving U5 pin 2; U5 pin 4 (output) is on net DISP_SCL along with R6 and U4 pin 18 (D0). The specification describes DISP_SCL as a direct connection from U2 pin 34 to R6 and U4 pin 18, with no U5.",
      "expected": "U2 pin 34 (PB13) should be directly on the DISP_SCL net together with R6 and U4 pin 18 (D0), with no intervening buffer and no separate Net-(U5-Pad2).",
      "evidence": [
        {"source": "spec", "quote": "DISP_SCL: U2 pin 34 (`PB13`) — R6 (10 kΩ) to VCC — U4 pin 18 (`D0`)"},
        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "(comp (ref \"U5\") (value \"74LVC1G34\") (footprint \"Package_TO_SOT_SMD:SOT-23-5\"))"},
        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "(net (code \"2\") (name \"DISP_SCL\") ... (node (ref \"R6\") (pin \"1\") ...) (node (ref \"U4\") (pin \"18\") (pinfunction \"D0\") ...) (node (ref \"U5\") (pin \"4\") (pintype \"output\")))"},
        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "(net (code \"24\") (name \"Net-(U5-Pad2)\") ... (node (ref \"U2\") (pin \"34\") (pinfunction \"PB13\") ...) (node (ref \"U5\") (pin \"2\") (pintype \"input\")))"}
      ],
      "impact": "The display SCL clock is driven through an always-enabled non-inverting buffer instead of directly by the MCU. The MCU pin is not on the I2C SCL net, and the pull-up R6 is on the buffer output rather than on the MCU-side input. If PB13 is configured as open-drain I2C, the buffer input will float when the MCU releases SCL, likely causing display communication failure or erratic SCL behavior.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design contains an extra 74LVC1G34 buffer U5 inserted in series with the display SCL line, contradicting the specification's direct connection between U2 pin 34 and U4 pin 18 and leaving the MCU-side SCL without the specified pull-up."
}

